  "translation": "Dugu kɔnɔ fana, a y'a ta: sarɛrisi kelen min tun ye kɛlɛkɛ mɔgɔw ɲɛmɔgɔ ye, ni cɛ duuru minnu bɛ masakɛ ɲɛ ye, minnu bidiye dugu kɔnɔ; ani ⟨את⟩ sɛbɛbaga, bentɔgɔw tigi, min bɛ dugukolo mɔgɔw labɛn; ni mɔgɔ biabɛn dugukolo mɔgɔw la, minnu bidiye dugu kɔnɔ.",
